Myanmar markana: uraq kjathati waraqatanaka Mä 6,8 patilla uräq khatatiw [en] noereste Myanmar mark thalthapiwayatayna, aka 24uru saraqataru Marzo phaxsita aka 2011marankasina. Ukaxa sismo [en], Tailandia, Vietnam ukjamaraqki China markanakaruxa kjatattayawarakikitayna, 70ka jaqinakaruwa jiwayawayi ukjamaruxa tukjawayarakitayna,240ka jach’a utanakraki [en] aka Myanmar markanxa. Ukatxa Chiang Mai, Chiang Rai ukjamaraki Tailandia markanakanxa uraq kjathatix utjawayakipunitaynawa. Jaqi jiwaratanakaxa yapxattaspawa. Yaqhip yatiyawinak tuqix, 25 viernes alwanxa 80ni jiwañ t’uxunakaw aljasitayna, [en] Tachileik ukana. Uraq kjathati uñakipt’irinaxa sapxiwa, kimsiri jan wali chijiwa, sasinaNargis (2008) y el ciclón Giri [en] (2010).

Yatiyawinak apnaqirixa The Irrawaddyyaqhipa markachirinakaruxa jiskt’awayiwa Mae Sai [en], Tailandia Markana. Má yatiyawi qhanañchawinxa Shan Herald, Jai Noi [en] qhanañchiwa kunjamtixa uraq qhathatixa residentes jupanakaru tukjki uka.

taqini munatanaka, taqpachaniwa arum paqar p’arikipxta, yaqhip pachanakaxa ikt’as ikt’as ukjamata wali p’ariki. Jawsañanakaxa janiw sum jawskiti , mayas mayasa. Uka pachanxa utax janiw kuna kamachañxamakisa. Arum paqariwa uta manqhana anqaru mistsusina qhantatipxta. Suyt’wa inay aka yatiyawix taqiniru purinipxiristama. Utjiwa taleranxa 40ka Km Alayan tuqinxa wali tukjatanaka, chakaxa jan wali tukjatawa. Ist’araqtwa taqpacha markawa aynacharu jutxii ukanxa mä qulliri tataqiw utji sasina, ukatxa usuchjatanakaxa Tachileik markaruw apayanipxi qhitinakatix qullañxamakana jukanakxa. Utxiwa 80ka jiwatanaka, janiw utxkituti juk’ampi yatitaxa. Utjaniwa juk’ampi usuchxatanaka. T’unthapiwixa, kunxamatix yatiyawinakanax sapki ukaxa Merng Lain, 59 km alay tuqirunxa Maesai markanwa akjam llakisiñanakax utjawayi. Jichhakamaxa utjaskiwa uka pächpa yatiyawinakaxa.

Blog ukaxa akm-kuntha apkatiwa waruqatanaka [my] thakhinaka Tarle, mä markawa 30 km Tachileik tuqina t’unxataki ukanaka.

Democratic Voice of Burma Ukjamarusuñicht’ayarakiwa [en] tukjat waraqatanaka. Ukatxa uñicht’ayarakiwa kunxamsa twiter tuqix yagon markanxa arsunipxi uka.

@ascmmr [en] munat jilatanaka, suyt’aptwa jumanakaru walikiskatanakama ukjamaraki qhisphitanakama aka uraq khathatita. Qhanpacha aka 24 de marzo 2011na 8:25ni pachanxa uraq qhathatixa utjawayi.

@minnyoonthit [en] uraq kjathatixa Shan, uka Tachileik markaruxa walwa thalthapiwayi (utxiwa 100 jiwaratanaka ukjamaraki walxa usuchxatanaka).

@blacksumo [en] jisa, ¿uraq kjathatix chiqanti? Amuyayatwa tiayalaxax samkaskatapa…

Akasti Libia Markan sartasiwinakapat yatiyawinaka, 2011n tuqit qillqaniwipawa.

Muammar Al Gaddafi uka dictador jaqixa, martis uruxa telivision estatal tuqiw markachirinakaru arsutayna, ukanxa kulirat kankañap uñicht’ayasitayna, ukjamarak khitinakatix mark apnaqirinakaru saykatapki ukanakar axsarayasina. Akjam sasina: Libia markaxa tukusiniwa kunjamtix Afganistán, Iraq o Somalia markanakax tukuski ukjama. Ukatxa sarakitaynawa: arumanthix thaqhir mistsupxam, mark yanqhachirinak (terrorista) tuqi, ukatxa irpkatapxam aka fuerzas de seguridad tuqinkirinakaru “jiwayañataki”, ukjamat juch uñt’ayañataki. Ukampirus sarakitaynawa: nayax Libia markatx juch jikiskakiwa “qhipha wil ch’aqaqayañkama” ukjam sasina. Ukatxa kunakasta lurawinakasa utjpan aka mark apnaqirinak tuqxa, jiwayataniwa. Juk'ampis arsuskakitaynawa, taqi khitinakatix anqax marka mayacht’atanakampi irnaqapkani, mark apnaqirinak tuqi jan wali lurapkani, yanqhachapkani ukanakax, jiwayatapxaniwa sasina. Aka arsuwixa wali jan amuyu jaqina arsupawa. Libia markachirinakampi uraq pachana twiter tuqinkirinakampi taqi akanakx arkapxatayna. Gadaffi jaqixa mä jan wali jaqxamawa sarti kunapachatixa Libia markaxa jan walina uñjaski ukjamaraki waljani markachirinaka jiwarkipana.

Gadaffi jaqixa mä yanqhachäwi kjitinakatix mark apnaqirinak tuqi arsupki ukanakarux uñicht’ayawayatayna. Ukatxa yaqha lurawinaka paskanxa Libya markanxa ukanakampit arsuwayatayna. Kunawsatixa yaqha mark apnaqirinakaxa jiwayapkataynawa taqi kjitinakatix mark apnaqirirnakaru saykatapkanxa jupanakaru. Ukatxa “mayacht’awix China Markanxa wali kjusanwa, taqi kjitinakatix plaza Tianamen tuqin jikxatasipkanxa ukanakatakixa”. Ukjamakasinxa sarakinwa, arumanthix waynanakaxa tamacht’asipxan turkakiptawi arxatañataki, jupanakpachaxaya qalltapxstaxa, sasaw arst'asiwaykakitayna.

Janira arskipanxa, yaqhipa twiter apnaqirinakaxa aruskipt’apxanwa maysaru uñtayasinakunawsatix jan ratuki arsunki ukata.

